data: {"type": "code", "agent": "CodeWizard", "timestamp": "2026-11-10T19:38:15.305051", "content": {"agent": "CodeWizard", "language": "python", "code": "sns.set_theme(style='whitegrid', palette='husl')\ndata = {'Quarter': ['Q1', 'Q2', 'Q3', 'Q4'], 'Revenue': [33.09, 173.93, 275.84, 270.73], 'NetProfit': [1.565, 7.563, 12.563, 12.632]}\ndf = pd.DataFrame(data)\nfor col in df.columns:\n    if col != 'Quarter':\n        df[col] = pd.to_numeric(df[col], errors='coerce')\ndf = df.dropna()\ndf['Margin'] = (df['NetProfit'] / df['Revenue'] * 100).round(2)\nfig, ax1 = plt.subplots(figsize=(12, 7), dpi=200)\nbars = ax1.bar(df['Quarter'], df['Revenue'], color='#6366f1', alpha=0.85, width=0.55, label='营业收入')\nfor b, v in zip(bars, df['Revenue']):\n    ax1.text(b.get_x() + b.get_width() / 2, v + 5, f'{v:.1f}', ha='center', fontsize=12, fontweight='bold', color='#4338ca')\nax1.set_xlabel('2025年季度', fontsize=14)\nax1.set_ylabel('营业收入（亿元）', fontsize=14, color='#4338ca')\nax1.tick_params(labelsize=12)\nax1.set_ylim(0, 330)\nax2 = ax1.twinx()\nax2.plot(df['Quarter'], df['NetProfit'], linewidth=2.5, marker='o', markersize=8, color='#10b981', label='归母净利润')\nax2.fill_between(df['Quarter'], df['NetProfit'], alpha=0.12, color='#10b981')\nfor x, y in zip(df['Quarter'], df['NetProfit']):\n    ax2.text(x, y + 0.7, f'{y:.2f}', ha='center', fontsize=11, fontweight='bold', color='#047857')\nax2.set_ylabel('归母净利润（亿元）', fontsize=14, color='#047857')\nax2.tick_params(labelsize=12)\nax2.set_ylim(0, 16)\nplt.title('中航成飞2025年季度经营表现（六代机2027年计划产量：未披露）', fontsize=18, fontweight='bold', pad=20)\nax1.grid(True, linestyle='--', alpha=0.3)\nsns.despine()\nplt.savefig('chart.png', dpi=200, bbox_inches='tight', facecolor='white')", "purpose": "核心问题「成飞2027年六代机计划产量」在全部可用数据中均标注为「未披露/None」，属于非公开的军工涉密信息，无法从财务披露数据中推导，因此结论为：公开数据不可得，不做任何臆测性估算。为提供有价值的分析，转而围绕唯一可用的实体（中航成飞，证券代码302132）2025年季度经营数据展开：清洗4个季度的营业收入与归母净利润，计算全年合计、季度环比增速、净利率等关键指标，并用「柱状图+折线」双轴组合图呈现收入规模与盈利质量的同步走势，同时在标题中明确标注六代机产量未披露，避免误导。"}}

